TI  - BLOW: A Systematic Approach to Behavior-Driven Development in a Layered Organization of Work-Centers
T2  - COMPUTERS
LA  - English
KW  - Behavior-Driven Development (BDD)
KW  - Acceptance Test-Driven Development (ATDD)
KW  - Test-Driven Development (TDD)
