TI  - Design Goals for End-User Development of Robot-Assisted Physical Training Activities: A Participatory Design Study
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE ACM ON HUMAN COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - Low-Code Development
KW  - Robot Programming
KW  - End-User Development
