AB  - Sometimes, the software deliverables do not exactly match with the requirements. This mismatch requirement can be captured during the testing. Even then if it is missing it is because of non-coverage of the testing and test cases. This could be resolved by creating the unit test cases / Integration test cases from the requirements. This paper focuses on BDD requirements which generates the test cases as well as report executed. With aid of automation testing, the test cases of BDD can be explained. This paper deals with such test cases, the next version binaries to get the proper deliverables.
