TI  - Engineering Prompt-Orchestrated LLM Workflows for Automated Test Case Generation in Agile Environments
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ADVANCED COMPUTER SCIENCE AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Software testing
KW  - test case generation
KW  - Large Language Models
KW  - Generative AI
