TI  - Optimizing cultivation substrate moisture and calcium application for the comprehensive growth of cucumber under different air temperatures
T2  - IRRIGATION SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - NITROGEN USE EFFICIENCY
KW  - WATER-USE EFFICIENCY
KW  - DRIP IRRIGATION
KW  - SATIVUS L.
